f/model for"}, {"id": "5f94f29f-b395-46aa-82a3-82a05a38ec2d", "type": "concept", "title": "cultural system"}, {"id": "17aa45ca-2dd7-483e-977b-778b655f6c26", "type": "concept", "title": "meaning"}, {"id": "be964bc1-63f5-48ac-97c0-b0d0be0f0a03", "type": "concept", "title": "description versus explanation"}, {"id": "5b6a40b5-b8ac-46d2-818c-fe669a63113f", "type": "concept", "title": "interpretive circle"}, {"id": "dc8ee85c-e789-4efb-bc9e-87977f8ec063", "type": "concept", "title": "local knowledge"}, {"id": "dc7f3463-8301-40f8-9841-4230358dc95a", "type": "concept", "title": "anti-anti-relativism"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces culture as webs of meaning and religion as a system of symbols, while also examining critiques of symbolic interpretation."}, {"id": "a8695e67-916e-46de-a7ed-9edde49cfe2e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethics of representation", "children": [{"id": "e19fd78c-903e-4083-a8d3-5f7418101fc9", "type": "concept", "title": "Specific terms and topics:"}, {"id": "05e34f34-72b9-4ae7-a3f9-f897427905d7", "type": "concept", "title": "informed consent"}, {"id": "4f05e47d-a0d0-42df-bb50-99e150425227", "type": "concept", "title": "confidentiality"}, {"id": "13089d56-9b64-41c4-b430-a60187c8ada3", "type": "concept", "title": "pseudonym"}, {"id": "4b497571-8ddf-43dc-b600-99370a54a879", "type": "concept", "title": "reciprocity"}, {"id": "3a22318e-045c-414c-b890-d6c94cf26f9c", "type": "concept", "title": "IRB"}, {"id": "e93988df-2755-4dda-9ed2-e30fa73b5bd6", "type": "concept", "title": "harm minimization"}, {"id": "db314a47-e35b-4fd7-a6ba-bab3abbf324d", "type": "concept", "title": "collaborative ethnography"}, {"id": "62fbc9bf-d397-40ea-a196-9cbe9bbfe785", "type": "concept", "title": "member checking"}, {"id": "57e4d70d-b1cd-4875-ae78-dc18f0b8a8cf", "type": "concept", "title": "representation"}, {"id": "fd2bc144-de3a-4379-9df6-6678c1af05a1", "type": "concept", "title": "extractive research"}], "description": "Students practice writing about communities wit